<p><m>\int_{0}^{3}\,e^x\,dx =</m> <fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><alert>(b)</alert></p>
<p>Find LEFT(2), RIGHT(2), TRAP(2), MID(2), and SIMP(4); compute the
error for each.</p>
<tabular bottom="medium" left="medium" right="medium" top="medium">
